## Key features

| Feature | Details |
|---|---|
| **Hover** | Darker background, lifted shadow, and slight upward shift. Applied only when enabled via `:not(:disabled)` |
| **Disabled** | Muted colors, no shadow, and a `not-allowed` cursor. Clicks are blocked |
| **Loading** | Shows a spinner, disables clicks, and sets `aria-busy` |
| **Focus** | A visible ring for keyboard users only, using `:focus-visible` |
| **Accessibility** | Native `<button>`, `aria-disabled`, decorative icons hidden from screen readers, and support for `prefers-reduced-motion` |
| **Flexible** | Forwards refs, passes through all native button props, and defaults to `type="button"` so it won't accidentally submit forms |
| **Themeable** | CSS custom properties make it easy to rebrand |

