## Key Design Decisions

| Feature | Why |
|---|---|
| **`:hover:not(:disabled)`** | Prevents hover effects from appearing on disabled buttons |
| **`forwardRef`** | Lets parent components focus the button or integrate with form libraries |
| **`type="button"` default** | Avoids accidentally submitting forms (HTML defaults to `submit`) |
| **`:focus-visible`** | Shows a focus ring for keyboard users without showing it on mouse clicks |
| **`aria-busy`** | Tells screen readers the button is processing during loading |
| **Loading disables clicks** | Prevents duplicate submissions |
| **CSS custom properties** | Easy theming without touching component code |
| **`prefers-reduced-motion`** | Accessibility for motion-sensitive users |
| **Spreads `...rest`** | Supports all native button props (`aria-label`, `form`, `data-*`, etc.) |

