## Key design decisions

| Feature | Why |
|---|---|
| **`:hover:not(:disabled)`** | Prevents hover effects from appearing on disabled buttons. |
| **`:focus-visible`** | Shows a focus ring for keyboard users only, not on mouse clicks. |
