## Key design decisions

| Feature | Why |
|---|---|
| `:hover:not(:disabled)` | Prevents hover styling from appearing on disabled buttons |
| `:focus-visible` | Shows a focus ring for keyboard users without showing it on mouse clicks |
| `type="button"` default | Avoids accidental form submissions (HTML defaults to `submit`) |
| `forwardRef` | Lets parents focus the button or integrate with form/tooltip libraries |
| `loading` disables the button | Prevents double-submits; `aria-busy` informs screen readers |
| CSS custom properties | Easy theming: override `--btn-bg` etc. on a parent or via `className` |
| `...rest` spread | Supports all native button props (`onClick`, `aria-label`, `form`, etc.) |
| Reduced-motion query | Respects users who've opted out of animations |

