## Key design decisions

| Feature | Why |
|---|---|
| **`:hover:not(:disabled)`** | Prevents hover effects from appearing on disabled buttons |
| **`:focus-visible`** | Shows focus ring for keyboard users only, not on mouse click |
| **`forwardRef`** | Lets parents focus the button or integrate with form/tooltip libraries |
| **Extends native button props** | Supports `aria-*`, `form`, `name`, etc. without extra work |
| **`type="button"` default** | Avoids accidental form submissions (native default is `submit`) |
| **`loading` implies disabled** | Prevents double-submits while an action is in progress |
| **CSS custom properties** | Easy theming: override `--btn-bg` etc. on a parent or via `className` |
| **Reduced-motion support** | Respects user accessibility preferences |

