## Key features

| Feature | How it works |
|---|---|
| **Darkened backdrop** | A fixed, full-screen overlay with `rgba(0,0,0,0.6)` |
| **Centered panel** | Flexbox centering on the backdrop |
| **Portal rendering** | `createPortal` renders the modal into `document.body`, so parent `overflow` or `z-index` styles can't clip it |
| **Escape to close** | A keydown listener on the document |
| **Backdrop click** | The modal closes only when the click starts on the backdrop, so dragging a text selection out of the panel won't close it |
| **Scroll lock** | `body` overflow is hidden while the modal is open |
| **Focus management** | Focus moves into the modal on open, Tab cycles inside it, and focus returns to the trigger on close |
| **Accessibility** | Uses `role="dialog"`, `aria-modal`, `aria-labelledby`, and a labeled close button |
| **Responsive** | Max width of 500px and max height of 90vh, with internal scrolling for long content |

