- **Hover / active** use `enabled:hover:` and `enabled:active:` rather than plain `hover:`. This matters: a bare `hover:bg-blue-700` still fires on a disabled button, so it would light up on hover even though it can't be clicked. The `enabled:` variant scopes the styles to non-disabled elements only.
