### Modal Interaction & Accessibility

This modal handles the common interaction details so you can drop it into any project.

- **Backdrop click to close** – Clicking the dark overlay dismisses the modal, but only when the click starts and ends on the backdrop itself, so dragging from inside the panel won't accidentally close it.
- **Escape key support** – Pressing Escape closes the modal, and the event is stopped from bubbling further.
- **Focus trap** – Tab and Shift+Tab cycle through focusable elements inside the panel, keeping keyboard focus within the dialog.
- **Scroll lock & focus restore** – The page behind the modal can't scroll while it's open, and focus returns to the element that opened it when the modal closes.
- **Portal rendering** – The modal is rendered into `document.body` via `createPortal`, avoiding stacking context issues.
- **Reduced motion** – The fade and pop-in animations are disabled for users who prefer reduced motion.
