- **Focus** uses `:focus-visible`, so mouse clicks don't leave a ring, but keyboard users always see one.
- Theme colors are exposed as CSS custom properties, so a dark mode or brand palette only needs to override `--btn-bg` / `--btn-bg-hover` / etc.

